"name":"Squeeze","sort":300000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"offensive","description":{"value":"<p>A giant jellyfish can fit into tight spaces as if it were a Medium creature. It can move at its full Speed while @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.kMcV8e5EZUxa6evt]{Squeezing}.</p>"},"publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":""},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"value":[]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":null},"effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!kgNMTHqUv35m6dDW.FzKgBxkvPetz2mpZ"}],"name":"Giant Jellyfish","system":{"abilities":{"cha":{"mod":-5},"con":{"mod":6},"dex":{"mod":4},"int":{"mod":-5},"str":{"mod":6},"wis":{"mod":0}},"attributes":{"ac":{"details":"","value":15},"allSaves":{"value":""},"hp":{"details":"","max":165,"temp":0,"value":165},"immunities":[{"exceptions":[],"type":"critical-hits"},{"exceptions":[],"type":"precision"}],"resistances":[{"doubleVs":[],"exceptions":[],"type":"bludgeoning","value":5},{"doubleVs":[],"exceptions":[],"type":"poison","value":10}],"speed":{"otherSpeeds":[{"type":"swim","value":20}],"value":0},"weaknesses":[{"exceptions":[],"type":"piercing","value":5},{"exceptions":[],"type":"slashing","value":5}]},"details":{"blurb":"","languages":{"details":"","value":[]},"level":{"value":7},"privateNotes":"","publicNotes":"<p>Unlike its smaller cousins, the giant jellyfish is an active predator that chases down its prey through reefs or open water. It can even squeeze its enormous bell-shaped body into the tight confines of shipwrecks to drape its mane of tentacles across the exposed flesh of its prey.</p><hr /><p>Many varieties of jellyfish drift through the world's oceans, feeding on fish and other tiny marine creatures. However, deadly species of monstrous jellyfish pose a threat to unwary swimmers and sailors alike. Note that while jellyfish are ani